00:03:27.120 --> 00:03:32.903
<v Host>It means third place. After a number, this word means place or rank.

00:03:33.503 --> 00:03:43.848
<v Slow>2日目のフリーで、中井選手は難しいジャンプ「トリプルアクセル」を成功させました。

00:03:44.647 --> 00:03:50.623
<v Host>On day two, in the free skate, Nakai landed a difficult jump, the triple axel.

00:03:51.223 --> 00:03:53.840
<v Vocab>難しい

00:03:54.240 --> 00:03:56.111
<v Host>It means difficult.

00:03:56.711 --> 00:03:59.159
<v Vocab>成功

00:03:59.560 --> 00:04:04.575
<v Host>It means success. With the verb, it means to succeed at something.

00:04:05.175 --> 00:04:13.000
<v Slow>フリーは1位で、合計は219.74点でした。

00:04:13.800 --> 00:04:20.255
<v Host>She was first in the free skate, and her total was two hundred nineteen point seven four points.

00:04:20.855 --> 00:04:23.160
<v Vocab>合計

00:04:23.560 --> 00:04:25.432
<v Host>It means total.

00:04:26.031 --> 00:04:27.903
<v Vocab>点

00:04:28.303 --> 00:04:30.872
<v Host>It means points, as in a score.

00:04:31.471 --> 00:04:38.192
<v Slow>3位から1位になって、逆転で優勝しました。

00:04:38.992 --> 00:04:42.687
<v Host>She went from third to first, winning from behind.

00:04:43.288 --> 00:04:45.591
<v Vocab>逆転

00:04:45.992 --> 00:04:49.663
<v Host>It means a reversal, coming from behind to win.

00:04:50.264 --> 00:05:00.824
<v Slow>中井選手は、去年のフランスの大会でも優勝していて、2年続けての優勝です。

00:05:01.624 --> 00:05:06.615
<v Host>Nakai also won this event in France last year, so this is two wins in a row.

00:05:07.216 --> 00:05:09.232
<v Vocab>去年

00:05:09.632 --> 00:05:11.504
<v Host>It means last year.

00:05:12.103 --> 00:05:14.456
<v Vocab>続ける

00:05:14.855 --> 00:05:18.815
<v Host>It means to continue. Here, two years in a row.

00:05:19.415 --> 00:05:27.072
<v Slow>演技が終わると、中井選手は笑顔でガッツポーズをしました。

00:05:27.872 --> 00:05:32.911
<v Host>When her performance ended, Nakai smiled and pumped her fist.

00:05:33.512 --> 00:05:35.624
<v Vocab>演技

00:05:36.024 --> 00:05:39.456
<v Host>It means a performance, like a routine on the ice.

00:05:40.055 --> 00:05:42.192
<v Vocab>終わる

00:05:42.591 --> 00:05:44.920
<v Host>It means to end or finish.

00:05:45.519 --> 00:05:47.680
<v Vocab>笑顔

00:05:48.079 --> 00:05:50.264
<v Host>It means a smiling face.

00:05:50.863 --> 00:05:56.144
<v Slow>日本の青木選手は、4位でした。

00:05:56.944 --> 00:05:59.512
<v Host>Japan's Aoki finished fourth.

